 "notes": "Stine Flat Ride Baseline1 (built as \"New Flat\"): built from SPEAR captures (Bow V1-V3, Edge V1-V3; bow and bell with the stick tip, no bell (a flat ride: no bell captures; --infer-bell only satisfies the builder, its bell ratios are not used, as SMOKE FLAT RIDE has none), edge with the shoulder) by build_preset.py: 900-mode bank from bow and edge partials (0.3 % clusters; exc from the bow captures only, 80th-percentile presence, gamma 0.8, <400 Hz x0.65), decay-fitted T60 calibrated per band to the SPEAR band decay (t60_scale 1.0), NPZ edge in the plugin's 22 bands with edge_rms_correction from the velw norms. Build-up as Bettis/Swish. Edge envelopes extended to 30 s and the envelope window 30 s (no ring returning after the window)."
